---
title: "Stress Test Page"
layout: "base.njk"
---

<style>
    .StressMap { aspect-ratio: auto; height: 60vh; min-height: 320px; }
    .StressControls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .StressControls label { display: block; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .StressControls .StressCheckbox { font-weight: normal; }
    .StressControls fieldset { border: none; padding: 0; }
    .StressControls legend { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .StressControls button { padding: 6px 14px; }
    .StressControls .StressGroup { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; align-items: flex-end; }
    .StressControls .StressGroup > legend { padding: 0 6px; }
    .StressStats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .StressStats strong { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .StressResults { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .StressResults table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
    .StressResults th, .StressResults td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 4px 8px; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
    .StressResults th:first-child, .StressResults td:first-child { text-align: left; }
</style>

<h1>Stress test</h1>

<p>
    Builds a lot of polylines and a lot of markers at the same time, each with its own tooltip and popup.
    This is the shape of a real trail map: many short segments plus many points of interest, all with something
    attached to them. The other test pages each measure one thing. This page exists because the expensive part
    is the combination.
</p>
<ul>
    <li>
        Everything is built from the <strong>seed</strong>, so two runs with the same settings build the same
        geometry. Change the seed for different data, keep it the same to compare a change fairly.
    </li>
    <li>
        "Separate" gives every polyline and every marker its own tooltip and popup object. "Shared" uses one
        tooltip and one popup for everything and changes the content when it opens. Only one can be visible at a
        time, so "Shared" is what "Separate" is measured against. Compare the time to build and the JS memory.
    </li>
    <li>
        "Polylines start hidden" uses the <code>visible: false</code> option. A hidden polyline isn't drawn, so
        nothing is created on the Google map for it until it's shown. Build with it on, then use
        "Show hidden polylines" to see what drawing them afterwards costs. Markers have no <code>visible</code>
        option, so they are always drawn when they're added.
    </li>
    <li>Run the zoom test after each build and compare the lowest frame rate. Each run is added to the results table.</li>
    <li>For JS memory, reload the page before each run. It's only reported in Chrome.</li>
    <li>On an iPhone, connect it to a Mac and open Safari's Web Inspector. Watch the console for "Total canvas memory use exceeds the maximum limit".</li>
    <li>Start small. 2,000 polylines with 1,000 points each and 5,000 markers with separate overlays will take a while.</li>
</ul>

<form id="controls" class="StressControls">
    <fieldset class="StressGroup">
        <legend>Polylines</legend>
        <div>
            <label for="polylineCount">How many</label>
            <select id="polylineCount" name="polylineCount">
                <option value="0">0</option>
                <option value="100">100</option>
                <option value="500" selected>500</option>
                <option value="1000">1,000</option>
                <option value="2000">2,000</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <label for="pointsPer">Points in each</label>
            <select id="pointsPer" name="pointsPer">
                <option value="10">10</option>
                <option value="50" selected>50</option>
                <option value="200">200</option>
                <option value="1000">1,000</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <label for="simplify">simplify</label>
            <select id="simplify" name="simplify">
                <option value="0">Off</option>
                <option value="2">2 meters</option>
                <option value="5">5 meters</option>
                <option value="10">10 meters</option>
                <option value="zoom" selected>Default zoom levels ('zoom')</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <label for="polylineOverlays">Tooltips and popups</label>
            <select id="polylineOverlays" name="polylineOverlays">
                <option value="none">None</option>
                <option value="each" selected>Separate per polyline</option>
                <option value="shared">Shared</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <label class="StressCheckbox"><input type="checkbox" name="startHidden"> Polylines start hidden</label>
        </div>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="StressGroup">
        <legend>Markers</legend>
        <div>
            <label for="markerCount">How many</label>
            <select id="markerCount" name="markerCount">
                <option value="0">0</option>
                <option value="500">500</option>
                <option value="1000" selected>1,000</option>
                <option value="2000">2,000</option>
                <option value="5000">5,000</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <label for="markerIcon">Icon</label>
            <select id="markerIcon" name="markerIcon">
                <option value="default">Default Google pin</option>
                <option value="svg">SVG icon (svgIcon option)</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <label for="markerOverlays">Tooltips and popups</label>
            <select id="markerOverlays" name="markerOverlays">
                <option value="none">None</option>
                <option value="each" selected>Separate per marker</option>
                <option value="shared">Shared</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <fieldset>
            <legend>optimized</legend>
            <label><input type="radio" name="optimized" value="unset" checked> Not set</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="optimized" value="true"> true</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="optimized" value="false"> false</label>
        </fieldset>
    </fieldset>

    <div>
        <label for="seed">Seed</label>
        <input type="number" id="seed" name="seed" value="1" min="1" step="1" style="width: 6em;">
    </div>
    <div>
        <button type="submit">Build</button>
        <button type="button" id="zoomTest">Run zoom test</button>
        <button type="button" id="showHidden" disabled>Show hidden polylines</button>
    </div>
</form>

<div class="StressStats">
    <span>Polylines: <strong id="statPolylines">0</strong></span>
    <span>Points: <strong id="statPoints">0</strong></span>
    <span>Markers: <strong id="statMarkers">0</strong></span>
    <span>Tooltip and popup objects: <strong id="statOverlays">0</strong></span>
    <span>Polylines built in: <strong id="statPolylineMs">-</strong></span>
    <span>Markers built in: <strong id="statMarkerMs">-</strong></span>
    <span>Total build: <strong id="statTotalMs">-</strong></span>
    <span>Time to show hidden: <strong id="statShowMs">-</strong></span>
    <span>Elements in the map: <strong id="statElements">-</strong></span>
    <span>Canvas elements: <strong id="statCanvases">-</strong></span>
    <span>Image elements: <strong id="statImages">-</strong></span>
    <span>JS memory (Chrome only): <strong id="statHeap">-</strong></span>
    <span>Frame rate: <strong id="statFps">-</strong></span>
    <span>Lowest frame rate while moving: <strong id="statLowestFps">-</strong></span>
    <span id="statStatus"></span>
</div>

<div id="map1" class="mapContainer StressMap"></div>

<h2>Results</h2>
<div class="StressResults">
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Polylines</th>
                <th>Points</th>
                <th>simplify</th>
                <th>Markers</th>
                <th>optimized</th>
                <th>Tooltips/popups</th>
                <th>Overlay objects</th>
                <th>Started hidden</th>
                <th>Polylines (ms)</th>
                <th>Markers (ms)</th>
                <th>Total (ms)</th>
                <th>Show hidden (ms)</th>
                <th>Elements</th>
                <th>Canvases</th>
                <th>Images</th>
                <th>JS memory (MB)</th>
                <th>Zoom test lowest FPS</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="results"></tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<script src="{{ '/js/stress.js'|url|safe}}"></script>
